  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 20 as printed (昭和 8-13年度 six rows; 臺北州 新竹州 臺中州 臺南州 高雄州 臺東廳 花蓮港廳 澎湖廳; 總督府 交通局 專賣局 基隆稅關 高雄稅關 營林所). Table spans pp. 504-505: left page 總額, 官有物拂下代 (總額, 物品, 地所, 建物, 船舶), 公債金特別會計受入, 返納 (總額, 定期貸金); right page 返納金 (據置貸金, a narrow column in tiny type), 前年度剩餘金繰入 .. 道路事業費分擔金; joined by row.",
   "Title: left page prints 468 '官有物拂下代共', right page continues 'ノ他臨時部歲入 (單位圓)' (faint '/'); the printed '共' is kept as printed (evidently a worn 其). Written as 官有物拂下代共ノ他臨時部歲入.",
   "Heading 返納 (letter-spaced) on the left page and 金 on the right page form 返納金 over four sub-columns: 總額, 定期貸金 (left) and 據置貸金, plus a narrow column whose heading is in tiny type (two lines, about six characters each); read as 臺灣拓殖會社設立費返納金 with low confidence (heading only; its single figure 58,901 is clear).",
   "Other column headings read: 國債償還資金獻納金 (printed in three lines), 嘉南大圳組合貸付金年賦償還金, 安平港口改良費納付金 (letter-spaced '安平港口改良費納付金'), 前年度剩餘金繰入.",
   "Totals (ten rows 臺北州..營林所 added to 同13年度): reconcile exactly: 建物 7,281; 返納 總額 499; 據置貸金 499; 前年度 46,391,943; 桃園大圳 35,069; 糖業試驗 100,000; 國債償還 335; 嘉南 1,503,400; 治水 1,081,411; 道路 63,150. Differences of 1-3 (rounding): 總額 (parts exceed total by 3), 拂下代 總額 (1), 物品 (1), 地所 (-1).",
   "Row checks: 拂下代 總額 = 物品+地所+建物+船舶 (±1) in all rows; 返納 總額 = 定期貸金 + 據置貸金 + 拓殖 (±1) in all rows; 總額 = 拂下代 + 公債金 + 返納 + the nine right-hand columns (±1) in all rows EXCEPT 同12年度: the parts add up to 45,549,449 against the printed 總額 45,519,450 (parts exceed total by 29,999). Cells of that row re-read twice (拂下代 911,063; 返納 494; 前年度 41,832,848; 桃園 35,069; 糖業 100,000; 嘉南 1,461,050; 治水 935,325; 安平 192,600; 道路 81,000), no single 3/8 confusion explains a difference of about 30,000, so the row is kept as printed and does NOT reconcile.",
   "Row 同12年度 col 前年度剩餘金繰入: last digits overprinted by show-through ('848' vs '818' possible); read 41,832,848.",
   "Alignment: figures read by row position; 總督府 row holds 154,337 (拂下) = 150,815 + 3,522 and 46,391,943 + 100,000 + 1,503,400; the 花蓮港廳 row holds 國債償還 335.",
   "Unit 圓.",
   "Title as read on the page: '官有物拂下代共ノ他臨時部歲入'; set to the 目次 form."
  ],
